[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5327547703","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122538#issuecomment-5327547703","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122538","id":5327547703,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPYvtNw","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-18T11:32:26Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T11:32:26Z","body":"Leaving this as a note for whoever takes up the task of adding wasm64 support.\r\n\r\n**At least** the following two points needs to be resolve:\r\n\r\n- The GodotRuntime (`library_godot_runtime.js`) needs handle 64 bits pointers by reading from the appropriate heap\r\n- All `library_*.js` exposed functions needs to have their `__sig:` updated to use `p` instead of `i` in cases where a pointer is referenced.\r\n\r\nThe latter, have a huge impact on `dlink_enabled=yes` builds, so after fixing the `__sig:` the gdextension version needs to be re-tested also against wasm32.\r\n\r\nThere's probably more, but that **may** be enough to get a working (albeit experimental) build.","author_association":"COL